 {
  "id": "5d5279a5a482e30031c00865",
  "name": "Widget - Recenzii Clienti",
  "type": "entrust-widget",
  "payload": {
   "title": "Peste 19 ani&l;br&g;de cooperare de succes",
   "description": "Procesele lungi si complexe le facem de zeci de ori mai simple. Afla cum serviciile si echipamentele companiei RTI contribuie la buna functionare si dezvoltare a afacerilor din Moldova. ",
   "slides": [
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/cf143596-9e35-46f5-8e71-2a99ee0947c8.png"
     },
     "description": "De 11 ani impreuna cu compania RTI avem o colaborare frumoasa. In aceasta perioada, am lansat multe proiecte, dintre care ultimul a fost Gourmet Fourchette. Cooperarea noastra consta in furnizarea si instalarea echipamentelor fiscale, cantare si retele IT. Recomand RTI cu incredere tuturor.",
     "author": "Adrian Lazarenco",
     "job": "Director general al retelei de magazine ",
     "company": "Fourchette",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uSTHbXbwI2I",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/jpeg",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/bcc09c58-95a5-4104-a005-a9f38015af18.jpg"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/750454b5-1aee-4a9b-a5d9-dba1b215985d.png"
     },
     "description": "Lucram cu compania RTI inca de la lansarea afacerii. Suntem foarte multumiti de colaborarea noastra. Cu incredere recomand tuturor companiilor care activeaza in domeniul HoReCA sa foloseasca serviciile RTI.",
     "author": "Mihai Tanase",
     "job": "Director general ",
     "company": "BERD&s;S Hotel",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DOvqtWMoZ_U",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/png",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/8b6e26ad-8c98-46f7-b4bf-aa767dc93162.png"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/png",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/4f6bf283-c608-426d-be9f-fbb72c2fd419.png"
     },
     "description": "Datorita sistemului de gestiune a proceselor de business implementat de compania RTI, care include echipamente si software, patiseria noastra obtine cele mai calitative rezultate in finante si management.",
     "author": "Dmitrii Bucicov",
     "job": "Co-fondator al retelei de patiserii",
     "company": "Covrigo",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M3LiHbD9uI4",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/png",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/6c403583-6484-42cf-b46c-c27b6957b3d6.png"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/webp",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/adc3f1c5-4785-48ab-a944-1ebc8b5a57a2.webp"
     },
     "description": "Restaurantul Black Rabbit Gastro-Burrow a ales solutia de gestiune iiko, deoarece este un program all-in-one, care integreaza vanzarile, achizitiile si toate rapoartele intr-un singur sistem. Toate operatiunile financiare si contabilitatea sunt centralizate.",
     "author": "Ecaterina Zidu",
     "job": "Manager restaurantului",
     "company": "Black Rabbit Gastro-Burrow",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iUUP_nweJ5k",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/jpeg",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/29da09b0-104d-4432-aed9-7a7174c17b5e.jpg"
      }
     }
    },
    {
     "image": {
      "mimetype": "image/webp",
      "path": "public/widgets/files/9c83f04d-7b3a-473b-92ec-db1003ba8680.webp"
     },
     "description": "Compania RTI ne-a furnizat solutii complete pentru facilitarea proceselor de gestiune si control al retelei de berarii DRAFT. Acest lucru ne permite sa fim pregatiti sa reactionam la toate schimbarile si sa gestionam eficient reteaua de la distanta. Recomand tuturor serviciile companiei RTI.",
     "author": "Zaitev Roman",
     "job": "Director comercial al retelei de berarii",
     "company": "Draft",
     "video": {
      "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6hZerpOQGKw",
      "image": {
       "mimetype": "image/png",
       "path": "public/widgets/files/88068d93-45d8-4c42-b830-c5d4ba7a6f26.png"
